# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# This is not cosmetic: `make verify-determinism` compares artifact bytes and the P9
# packet gate requires two renders to be byte-identical, so a platform-dependent
# checkout of a text artifact would fail a gate that the code passes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.parquet binary
*.zip binary
*.csv text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jar binary
